DETAILED DESCRIPTION OF THE INVENTION

Embodiments of the present invention will be hereinafter described with reference to FIGS. 1 to 5. FIGS. 1 and 2 show a first embodiment of a dual type constant velocity universal joint according to the present invention. FIG. 1 shows the state where the operating angle is 0°, and FIG. 2 shows the state where the operating angle is 32°. The dual type constant velocity universal joint has a structure formed by integrating two ordinary fixed-type constant velocity universal joints of same specifications.

